    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to bring 13 Bellgree Woods to the Dublin 15 market. This is a 2 bed 2 bath mid terrace family home ideal for first time buyers starting on the property ladder. Tyrrelstown is a well-established and highly sought-after location, with a wide range of amenities close by including shops, cafés, schools, childcare facilities, parks and public transport links. The N3/M50 motorway network is also within easy reach, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nNo.13 offers bright & well-proportioned accommodation throughout of approximately 78 sq m which comprises of a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room, and a well-appointed kitchen/dining area with access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are two generous bedrooms, including a master ensuite and main family bathroom providing excellent convenience for modern living. Outside, the property benefits from a private rear garden offering a pleasant outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>2 spacious bedrooms</li>\n <li>2 bathrooms</li>\n <li>Mid-terrace property</li>\n <li>Bright and well-proportioned accommodation</li>\n <li>Private rear garden</li>\n <li>Excellent residential location</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>C. 78 sq m</li>\n <li>Close to shops, schools and local amenities</li>\n <li>Easy access to public transport</li>\n <li>Convenient access to M50 and Dublin Airport</li>\n <li>Ideal first-time buyer or investment opportunity</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\nEircode = D15 N2H4. When you are parking in the car park, walk around the left hand side and you will see No. 13 facing the communal gardens."
      },
      {
